Subject: October safety training schedule

Hi team,

Please find the October safety training schedule below. We need to book the training room, so kindly confirm your attendance by Friday. I will upload the slides to the shared drive after each session.

Thanks,

{P1}
{P1.org}
{P1.dept}
{P1.job}

Local Business Weekly - {DATE}

{P1}, {P1.job} at {P1.org}, said the regional small business support program will open to applications next month. “We want the process to be simpler for owners who have never applied for a grant before,” {P1.s} told reporters after the briefing.

Applications will be accepted at the district office starting in the fall. Questions can be directed to {ORG}'s information desk at {ORG.phone}.

DELIVERY CONFIRMATION

Recipient: {P1}
Delivery address: {P1.addr}
Order reference: {CODE}
Service: Standard ground delivery
Delivery date: {DATE}
Left at: Building lobby, with the recipient's agreement

Courier note: Recipient was not at home during the first attempt. Package was checked for damage and found to be in good condition.

This confirmation may be used as proof of delivery if a dispute arises.

Recipient signature on file: {P1.s}

{P1}
{P1.addr}

{DATE}

