Customer message: I paid for the bundle last Tuesday, but the points never showed up on my account. I attached the payment screenshot. Please let me know what is happening.

Agent note: Payment confirmed in the billing system. Points are being re-issued manually, and a confirmation email will follow.
Assigned to: {P2.s}

MEMBERSHIP RENEWAL NOTICE

Member number: {P1.id}
Current tier: Standard
Renewal due: {DATE}

Your membership is due for renewal. To keep your current benefits without interruption, please renew through the member portal before the due date. Renewal takes less than five minutes and no new forms are required.

If your membership lapses, reinstatement fees may apply. Reply to this notice or visit the help page if you have questions about your renewal.

Thank you for reading this month's newsletter. We appreciate your continued support.

{ORG}
Headquarters and branch information is available on our website.
